# Native Quick Practice routing-cancel acceptance.
# The workflow uses the existing acceptance-only auto-start hook at settled
# Modern main, then sends Escape while host-owned routing is active. The host
# must restore the Practice snapshot/root and settle back at Modern main without
# entering a Practice race.

until 009F == D7 3600
dump practice-cancel-main
wait 30
until 009F == D7 1800
wait 60
dump practice-cancel-returned-main
quit
